  "description": "Eighteen-year-old Misa finds life hard, torn apart by constant pressure. She wakes up after a car accident on a school trip, only to find herself ten years into the future?! \n\n\"I'm twenty-eight?\" Suddenly, a handsome man, Jung Yoon-Ha, appears before her. \"I'm your husband.\" Oh my! … … Wait, isn't this a huge win? A wife with amnesia and a husband full of secrets: the perilous newlywed story!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13811423), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69006777), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/845054777), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/nmcouple), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000077521), [MComics](https://www.mcomics.co.kr/webtoonComic/14432), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260214)",
